abstract: >-
  AutoBarcoder is a Python tool for demultiplexing and clustering RNA
  barcodes from 96-well-plate sequencing reads. It uses Levenshtein
  distance and a connected-components graph (NetworkX) to group similar
  barcodes per well and outputs per-well summaries (TXT + PDF) plus an
  interactive web frontend.
